; collect.script: the summary lines of a soak (soak.script) and the
; machine's free memory now.
;   Execute SHARED:vbench/collect.script
FailAt 30
Echo "== results"
Search RAM:soak-recv.txt RAM:soak-send.txt RAM:soak-rtt.txt RAM:soak-faults.txt " soak" NONUM
Search RAM:soak-faults.txt "faults:" NONUM
Echo "== rounds"
Search RAM:soak-recv.txt RAM:soak-send.txt RAM:soak-rtt.txt "rounds " NONUM
Echo "== memory"
Search RAM:soak-recv.txt RAM:soak-send.txt RAM:soak-rtt.txt "free memory:" NONUM
Echo "== driver and stack"
Search RAM:soak-recv.txt "driver:" NONUM
Search RAM:soak-recv.txt "interface:" NONUM
Search RAM:soak-recv.txt "tcp:" NONUM
Echo "== failed rounds"
Search RAM:soak-recv.txt RAM:soak-send.txt RAM:soak-rtt.txt "FAILED" NONUM
Avail
